  "_layout": "Per vendor 'layout' = the defaults the map layout editor previews and the game uses when a TownVendors.json entry omits a sign or stall anchor: offsets are relative to the merchant (NPC) in cm, +X = the way he faces (toward customers), yaw in degrees relative to his facing. 'stall.size' = [depth (x), width (y), height (z)] of the stall footprint; a placed stall with another size scales every stall prop offset per axis and each prop uniformly. Stall prop x/y are relative to the stall anchor; 'onCounter' props stand on the counter top ('counterTop', cm, scaled by size z)."
